// expect-error: E-VERIFY-LEASE
// target: kernel
// While a processor holds a lease on a tree (it may be running on it),
// nothing can be taken out of it: the processor could still reach the
// table through its TLB or a page walk under way.
fn main(pool: &mut Pool, mmu: &mut Mmu) {
  if pool_size(pool) > 1 {
    let mut root = pt_new(pool_take(&mut pool, 0), 4);
    pt_put(&mut root, 1, pt_new(pool_take(&mut pool, 1), 3));
    let l = mmu_enter(&mut mmu, &mut root);
    pool_give(&mut pool, pt_free(pt_take(&mut root, 1)));
    mmu_exit(&mut mmu, l);
    pool_give(&mut pool, pt_free_root(mmu, root));
  }
}
